 `compiler_name`\r\n- `compiler_version`\r\n- `optimization_level`\r\n- `optimization_lto`\r\n\r\nThis is also mentioned in the editor's **Copy System Info** copied information. For example, on my system using a debug build, it now returns:\r\n\r\n> Godot v4.6.dev (19e2b2eb0) - Fedora Linux 42 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (nvidia; 580.82.09) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.33 GiB memory - Compiled on Linux with GCC 15.2.1, optimization: none, LTO: none\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10788.\r\n\r\n## TODO\r\n\r\n- [ ] ~~Mention this information on startup when running a binary with `--verbose`.~~\r\n  - This will be done in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/75025 instead if this PR is merged.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined 